歠仇水上，去高柳北三百餘里，兵馬甚盛；東、西部大人皆歸焉。因南抄緣邊，北拒丁零，東卻夫餘，西擊烏孫，盡據匈奴故地，東西萬四千餘里。","content_fanyi":"起初，鲜卑人檀石槐勇猛强健，富有谋略，部落中人对他既畏惧又信服，于是他施行法令禁令，明断是非曲直，没有人敢于违犯，众人便推举他为首领。檀石槐在弹污山、歠仇水边建立王庭，位于高柳以北三百余里，兵马十分强盛；东部、西部的首领都前来归附。鲜卑于是向南抄掠沿边各郡，向北抗拒丁零，向东击退夫馀，向西攻打乌孙，完全占据了匈奴旧地，东西绵延一万四千余里。","content_jianti_auto":"2初，鲜卑檀石槐，勇健有智略，部落畏服，乃施法禁，平曲直，无敢犯者，遂推以为大人。檀石槐立庭于弹污山、歠仇水上，去高柳北三百余里，兵马甚盛；东、西部大人皆归焉。因南抄缘边，北拒丁零，东却夫余，西击乌孙，尽据匈奴故地，东西万四千余里。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4571,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"96e1fc95-db0e-11ef-bd26-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"袁","people_name_jianti_auto":"袁","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"96e2acb9-db0e-11ef-b3da-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李膺","people_name_jianti_auto":"李膺","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"96e2acba-db0e-11ef-b802-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"范","people_name_jianti_auto":"范","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"96e2acbb-db0e-11ef-ad34-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鮮卑","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲜卑","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"96e2acbc-db0e-11ef-98e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遼東","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽东","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"96e2acbd-db0e-11ef-9370-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遼","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"96e2acbe-db0e-11ef-a458-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：袁紀：「延熹二年六月，鮮卑寇遼東，度遼將軍李膺擊破之。」今從范書。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：袁纪：「延熹二年六月，鲜卑寇辽东，度辽将军李膺击破之。」今从范书。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"96e2acb8-db0e-11ef-9c04-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"烏桓校尉","official_note":"烏桓校尉是漢朝設置的官職，負責管理烏桓事務，常駐邊疆，具有軍事和行政職能。在上下文中，李膺曾任此職，後被任命爲度遼將軍，顯示其從邊疆管理轉爲更高級軍事指揮。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以故烏桓校尉李膺爲度遼將軍","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"4ea02bc6-37de-429b-9078-ca463d59aa90"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"度遼將軍","official_note":"度遼將軍是漢朝將軍名號，負責防禦北方邊境，特別是遼東地區，常由經驗豐富的將領擔任。在上下文中，李膺被任命爲此職，以應對檀石槐的入侵，顯示其軍事指揮職責。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以故烏桓校尉李膺爲度遼將軍","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a3a30163-d41d-4168-9e63-5dcf3b6dd652"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":136,"link_death_year":181,"link_td_description":"檀石槐，是中国东汉时期的鲜卑首领之一。","link_td_id":"Q10008747","link_td_number_id":375777,"people_name":"檀石槐","people_name_jianti_auto":"檀石槐","people_xingming":"檀石槐","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"96e2acc2-db0e-11ef-a74d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":110,"link_death_year":169,"link_td_description":"李膺，字元礼，颍川襄城（今河南省襄城县）人。东汉时期名臣，党锢之祸中的党人领袖之一。","link_td_id":"Q10009152","link_td_number_id":537791,"people_name":"李膺","people_name_jianti_auto":"李膺","people_xingming":"李膺","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"96e2acc3-db0e-11ef-8ccb-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":110,"link_death_year":169,"link_td_description":"李膺，字元礼，颍川襄城（今河南省襄城县）人。东汉时期名臣，党锢之祸中的党人领袖之一。","link_td_id":"Q10009152","link_td_number_id":537791,"people_name":"膺","people_name_jianti_auto":"膺","people_xingming":"李膺","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"96e2acc4-db0e-11ef-8cdb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雲中","place_name_jianti_auto":"云中","resolved_place_entity_id":379,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"96e2acc5-db0e-11ef-9512-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"烏桓","place_name_jianti_auto":"乌桓","resolved_place_entity_id":339,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"96e2acc6-db0e-11ef-b01a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遼","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽","resolved_place_entity_id":493,"start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"96e2acc7-db0e-11ef-8cd9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","resolved_place_entity_id":140,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"96e2acc8-db0e-11ef-9fbd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"胡","resolved_place_entity_id":78,"start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"96e2acc9-db0e-11ef-b353-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与鲜卑的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0613"},{"title":"东汉与羌的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0606"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事","人事"],"content":"秋，七月，檀石槐寇雲中。以故烏桓校尉李膺爲度遼將軍。膺到邊，羌、胡皆望風畏服，先所掠男女，悉詣塞下送還之。","content_fanyi":"秋季七月，檀石槐攻掠云中郡。桓帝任命前任乌桓校尉李膺为度辽将军。李膺到达边地后，羌人、胡人都望风畏惧归服，把先前掳掠的男女全部送到塞下归还。","content_jianti_auto":"秋，七月，檀石槐寇云中。以故乌桓校尉李膺为度辽将军。膺到边，羌、胡皆望风畏服，先所掠男女，悉诣塞下送还之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4572,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"96e2acb7-db0e-11ef-935e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"96e2accd-db0e-11ef-bd13-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"嬴縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"嬴县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96e2acce-db0e-11ef-a300-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"泰山郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰山郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"96e2accf-db0e-11ef-9a3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"兗州","place_name_jianti_auto":"兖州","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"96e2acd0-db0e-11ef-9d5e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"博城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"博城县","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"96e2acd1-db0e-11ef-9a6f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"嬴縣，屬泰山郡。賢曰：故城在今兗州博城縣東北。治，直之翻。掾，俞絹翻。長，知兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"嬴县，属泰山郡。贤曰：故城在今兖州博城县东北。治，直之翻。掾，俞绢翻。长，知两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"96e2accc-db0e-11ef-abe0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"主者，主倉粟之吏也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"主者，主仓粟之吏也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"96e2acd2-db0e-11ef-8a8b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96e2acd4-db0e-11ef-878f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荀淑","people_name_jianti_auto":"荀淑","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"96e2acd5-db0e-11ef-9f61-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韓韶","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩韶","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"96e2acd6-db0e-11ef-b9b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳寔","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈寔","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"96e2acd7-db0e-11ef-abe5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鍾皓","people_name_jianti_auto":"钟皓","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"96e2acd8-db0e-11ef-82ae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"當塗","place_name_jianti_auto":"当涂","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"96e2acd9-db0e-11ef-968d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"嬴","place_name_jianti_auto":"嬴","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"96e2acda-db0e-11ef-b8b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"太丘","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"96e2acdb-db0e-11ef-8a98-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"林慮","place_name_jianti_auto":"林虑","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"96e2acdc-db0e-11ef-9744-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：謂荀淑爲當塗長，韓韶爲嬴長，陳寔爲太丘長，鍾皓爲林慮長也。長，知兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：谓荀淑为当涂长，韩韶为嬴长，陈寔为太丘长，钟皓为林虑长也。长，知两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"96e2acd3-db0e-11ef-86a9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children