rences":[],"class_tags":["军事","人事"],"content":"4初，鮮卑寇遼東，屬國都尉段熲率所領馳赴之。旣而恐賊驚去，乃使驛騎詐齎璽書召熲，熲於道僞退，潛於還路設伏；虜以爲信然，乃入追熲，熲因大縱兵，悉斬獲之。坐詐爲璽書，當伏重刑；以有功，論司寇；刑竟，拜議郞。至是，詔以東方盜賊昌熾，令公卿選將帥有文武材者。司徒尹頌薦熲，拜中郞將，擊舉、竇等，大破斬之，獲首萬餘級，餘黨降散。封熲爲列侯。","content_fanyi":"起初，鲜卑侵犯辽东郡，属国都尉段颎率领所部急速前往迎击。不久，段颎担心鲜卑受惊逃走，便派驿骑假传皇帝诏书征召他回京都洛阳，他在途中假装撤退，暗中在返回的路上设下埋伏；鲜卑信以为真，于是入境追击段颎，段颎趁机大举出兵，将鲜卑军全部斩杀俘获。段颎因假造皇帝诏书获罪，本应处以重刑；因有战功，被判处二年司寇刑；刑满之后，被任命为议郎。到这时，桓帝下诏，认为东方盗贼势力猖獗，命令公卿选拔具有文武才能的将帅。司徒尹颂举荐段颎，段颎被任命为中郎将，率军攻打公孙举、东郭窦等人，大败并斩杀他们，斩获首级一万多级，残余部众或降或散。段颎被封为列侯。","content_jianti_auto":"4初，鲜卑寇辽东，属国都尉段颎率所领驰赴之。既而恐贼惊去，乃使驿骑诈赍玺书召颎，颎于道伪退，潜于还路设伏；虏以为信然，乃入追颎，颎因大纵兵，悉斩获之。坐诈为玺书，当伏重刑；以有功，论司寇；刑竟，拜议郞。至是，诏以东方盗贼昌炽，令公卿选将帅有文武材者。司徒尹颂荐颎，拜中郞将，击举、窦等，大破斩之，获首万余级，余党降散。封颎为列侯。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4574,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"96e2acee-db0e-11ef-b4a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad0b-db0e-11ef-8175-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：乙十六行本「地」上有「京師」二字；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：乙十六行本「地」上有「京师」二字；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad0a-db0e-11ef-80f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad09-db0e-11ef-b89c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5冬，十二月，地震。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十二月，发生了地震。","content_jianti_auto":"5冬，十二月，地震。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4575,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad08-db0e-11ef-9d6c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"袁","people_name_jianti_auto":"袁","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad0e-db0e-11ef-8277-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"馬","people_name_jianti_auto":"马","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad0f-db0e-11ef-b19d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"桃","people_name_jianti_auto":"桃","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad10-db0e-11ef-8379-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"范","people_name_jianti_auto":"范","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad11-db0e-11ef-a3dc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"城父縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"城父县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad12-db0e-11ef-ba66-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汝南郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝南郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad13-db0e-11ef-8449-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"城父縣，屬汝南郡。考異曰：袁紀：馬、桃封在建和元年；「馬」作「焉」，「桃」作「祧」。今從范書。","note_content_jianti_auto":"城父县，属汝南郡。考异曰：袁纪：马、桃封在建和元年；「马」作「焉」，「桃」作「祧」。今从范书。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad0d-db0e-11ef-b3fd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":101,"link_death_year":156,"link_td_description":"梁不疑，又名藉，安定郡烏氏縣（今寧夏固原）人，東漢時期外戚。","link_td_id":"Q10007466","link_td_number_id":803463,"people_name":"梁不疑","people_name_jianti_auto":"梁不疑","people_xingming":"梁不疑","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"96e2ad17-db0e-11ef-957a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"馬","people_name_jianti_auto":"马","people_xingming":"梁马","start_i